       <text:p text:style-name="P4"><text:span text:style-name="T1">Total Project payment for projects with more than 300 Lots </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T2">must </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">be calculated separately using the restrictions of Item P-501 paragraph 8.1. Contact Rodney Joel, P.E., 816-329-2631 to add additional lots to this sheet. <text:s/>The results for &quot;Dollars&quot; in column &quot;I&quot; are valid and may be used when more Lots exist.</text:span></text:p>
       <text:p text:style-name="P4"><text:span text:style-name="T1"/></text:p>
       <text:p text:style-name="P4"><text:span text:style-name="T1">The user of this spreadsheet assumes all responsibility for the accuracy of the data and subsquent calculations. <text:s/>The user should confirm all calculations performed.</text:span></text:p>
       <draw:enhanced-geometry svg:viewBox="0 0 21600 21600" draw:type="mso-spt202" draw:enhanced-path="M 0 0 L 21600 0 21600 21600 0 21600 0 0 Z N"/>
